cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using these metadata."
type: software
title: "lgc-toolkit: Local Geometric Consistency for cross-subject EEG transfer learning"
abstract: >-
  A Python implementation of Local Geometric Consistency (LGC) for cross-subject EEG classification. LGC aggregates
  neighbouring covariance matrices through Riemannian averaging within recording segments; the toolkit provides
  symmetric and random neighbourhoods, RCT + MDM with an unlabelled target, calibrated TSA with logistic regression,
  and leave-one-subject-out evaluators that alone hold the evaluation labels.
